# Only the built site is uploaded.
#
# `public/` is generated by `npm run build:vercel` and already contains
# everything the deployment serves — the mirror, the sibling host directories
# and the app. Uploading the sources too would roughly double a deployment that
# is already ~729 MB, and the 507 MB of pre-rebrand backups in _quarantine/ must
# never leave this machine.
#
# `/*` ignores top-level entries only, so the un-ignored directories below are
# still descended into. Ignoring a directory outright would stop Vercel from
# ever looking inside it, and no `!` rule could bring its contents back.

/*

!/public
!/vercel.json
